<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Routing Proses · Mitsutoyo ERP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/part-routing.css"></head><body>
<header><div><small>MITSUTOYO ERP / ENGINEERING</small><h1>Routing Proses</h1><p id="routing-part-title">Susun urutan proses sesuai kebutuhan part.</p></div><nav><a href="/master-data/parts">Master Part</a><a href="/modules/engineering/bom-processes">Daftar Routing</a></nav></header>
<main><div id="routing-message" role="status" hidden></div><div class="routing-layout"><aside id="routing-sidebar" class="routing-panel"><h2>Routing part</h2><button type="button" id="routing-new">+ Routing baru</button><div id="routing-list"></div></aside><section class="routing-panel"><form id="routing-form"><div class="routing-section"><h2 id="routing-form-title">Routing baru</h2><button type="button" id="routing-delete" hidden>Hapus routing</button></div><div class="routing-fields"><label>Kode routing<input id="routing-code" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Kode unik routing"></label><label>Revisi<input id="routing-revision" maxlength="30" value="1" required></label><label>Status<select id="routing-status"><option>DRAFT</option><option>ACTIVE</option><option>INACTIVE</option></select></label></div><div id="routing-part-picker"><div class="routing-search"><label>Cari part<input id="routing-part-search" placeholder="Kode atau nama part"></label><button type="button" id="routing-search">Cari</button></div><label>Part<select id="routing-part" required><option value="">Pilih part</option></select></label></div><div class="routing-fields"><label>Berlaku mulai<input id="routing-from" type="date"></label><label>Berlaku sampai<input id="routing-until" type="date"></label></div><label>Catatan routing<textarea id="routing-notes" rows="2" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><div class="routing-section"><h2>Urutan proses</h2><button id="routing-add-operation" type="button">+ Tambah proses</button></div><p class="routing-help">Pilih proses dari master dan tentukan nomor urut yang unik. Kategori part tidak mengisi urutan proses secara otomatis.</p><div id="routing-operations"></div><footer><button type="submit" id="routing-save">Simpan routing</button><span>Routing yang sudah digunakan oleh BOM dipertahankan sebagai histori; buat revisi baru untuk perubahan.</span></footer></form></section></div></main>
<script id="routing-config" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify({partKey,routingKey,mode}).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script><script src="/js/part-routing.js" defer></script></body></html>
